00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<i>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</i>

00:01:39.530 --> 00:01:41.120
Good morning, Cosmo.

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:43.080
Did you sleep well last night?

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:45.200
Are you going to see your mother?

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:46.910
Give her my regards.

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:51.290
Sis!

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:56.510
Cosmo, good morning. You seem better this morning.

00:01:57.260 --> 00:02:03.060
I'm sorry. My mistake yesterday created trouble for everyone.

00:02:03.310 --> 00:02:07.980
It happens all the time, so we're used to it!

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:22.910
Good morning, Mother!

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:25.450
Good morning, Mother.

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:32.920
Do you think Mother is dreaming of our home planet again?

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:34.380
I'm sure she is.

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:38.380
What was our home like?

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:39.680
I wonder…

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:45.100
Mother is the only one on this ship that knows about our home.

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:50.140
Why are Mother and us continuing on this long journey?

00:02:50.390 --> 00:02:55.110
We have to stop Metarex from destroying the galaxy.

00:02:55.110 --> 00:02:59.360
It's the only way we can pay for our sins.

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:05.870
Let's get going. We have a lot to do today!

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:06.410
Okay!

00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:09.540
Goodbye, Mother.

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:18.490
Episode 62

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:18.490
The Secret of the Underground Valley

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:36.980
The Metarex are attacking!

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:40.650
Plants #3 and #7 are completely damaged!

00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:42.450
The next generation of seeds are destroyed!

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:44.200
Deploying shields!

00:03:51.910 --> 00:03:53.830
Cosmo!

00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:05.680
We're detecting the Chaos Emerald somewhere nearby, but we can't pinpoint the location.

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:12.770
Maybe it's in a special place, like in a river or buried underground?

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:16.690
Our only choice is to split up and search everywhere!

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:19.570
Then let's go!

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:28.450
Do your best, everyone!

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:38.090
Cosmo seems sad.

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:46.510
Even though she had her revenge, it doesn't change anything.

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:58.520
They already stole this planet's Planet Egg.

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:05.780
The people left this place a long time ago.

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:10.780
The city is dead.

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:18.380
Even if we retrieve the Planet Egg, the dead can never return.

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:23.710
Even though we defeated the Hell Ship, my sister will never return.

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:32.810
What is it?

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:35.180
It's nothing.

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:36.690
Check this out!

00:05:40.810 --> 00:05:43.530
It must have collapsed a long time ago.

00:05:48.610 --> 00:05:52.330
I'm detecting the Chaos Emerald below.

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:03.630
Look at that!

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:10.390
Do you see something?

00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:11.470
Please wait.

00:06:20.600 --> 00:06:23.400
It's so dark that I can't see a thing.

00:06:28.240 --> 00:06:29.570
What's wrong?

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:31.870
There was a switch.

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:40.620
Watch out!

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:51.550
Tails! Cosmo!

00:06:54.300 --> 00:06:58.060
Tails, are you okay?

00:06:58.060 --> 00:06:59.230
Cosmo…

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:01.480
Where are we?

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:03.650
Are you okay?

00:07:03.650 --> 00:07:05.320
Nothing serious.

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:12.870
I see. We fell down this cliff.

00:07:14.070 --> 00:07:18.660
I'm sorry. It's my fault for pressing that weird switch.

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:21.080
That's not true.

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:26.710
The fact that there's a switch means that something may be hidden here.

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:28.670
Is it a Metarex?

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:31.550
Chris! Amy!

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:34.970
It's no good. The transmission is blocked.

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:36.560
I'm sorry.

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:39.270
I said that you don't have to apologize.

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:45.400
I'm detecting that the Chaos Emerald is closer.

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:46.190
Let's go!

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:47.400
Wait.

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:54.030
C'mon, it's no big deal.

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:57.990
No, it's my fault that you were hurt.

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:06.710
We finally found our third Chaos Emerald.

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:11.220
Of the remaining four, we don't know where two of them are.

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:15.550
Shadow took the other two from Eggman.

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:20.720
I wonder if Shadow is still helping Eggman fulfill his goals.

00:08:21.230 --> 00:08:22.520
Or...

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:29.400
Shadow was a little scary, but I don't think he's evil.

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:30.730
Right, Cheese?

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:37.030
If he's also looking for the Chaos Emeralds, then we'll eventually meet him again.

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:38.330
You're right.

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:41.370
This is Blue Typhoon! Sonic, can you hear me?

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:42.750
Amy?

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:45.000
Knuckles sent me an emergency message!

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:48.790
There was a landslide, and Tails and Cosmo are missing!

00:08:55.430 --> 00:08:58.760
When we get back, I have to modify the receiver.

00:08:59.220 --> 00:09:04.060
There's no point if we can't use it during emergencies.

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:04.890
Yes…

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:09.520
Or maybe I should build a new tracking device.

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:14.320
I got the idea when I saw the shoe attachments that Chris made for Sonic.

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:19.700
If I adjust the manipulator to interact with the transformation patterns, I'll have a great automatic tracking device!

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:21.950
I messed up again.

00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:28.210
All I do is get in everyone's way.

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:32.590
I put everyone in danger.

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:39.850
They wouldn't have stolen the Planet Egg from Sonic's planet if I was more reliable.

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:42.810
If Sonic's planet...

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:47.850
...is destroyed, just like this one...

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:53.530
It's my fault.

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:55.400
Cosmo…

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:59.570
I'm sorry. I'm boring you by talking about machines and stuff.

00:09:59.570 --> 00:10:02.030
No, that's not it.

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:07.920
It's my fault that we're in this predicament.

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:13.590
Don't worry, even though you're probably scared because I'm not good enough to save you.

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:18.220
That's not true! You're very reliable, Tails!

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:19.130
Really?

00:10:19.130 --> 00:10:20.840
Yes, really!

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:26.850
Glowing insects? I didn't know these were living creatures!

00:10:34.150 --> 00:10:36.030
Is there something over there?

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:36.990
Let's check it out.

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:37.740
Okay.

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:46.540
Where are we?

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:10.730
Tails and Cosmo, I'm coming to rescue you!

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:17.280
If he keeps digging like that, isn't he going to cause a cave-in?

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:20.450
Knuckles knows what he's doing.

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:21.860
I think…

00:11:22.990 --> 00:11:26.040
I'm scanning using infrared and ultrasonic waves.

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:30.410
Below this area is a complex maze of caves.

00:11:30.710 --> 00:11:33.580
Several of the caves connect to the surface.

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:37.550
Let's put markers along the way so that we won't get lost.

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:41.510
I'm worried about Cosmo because she seemed depressed.

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:43.760
Let's rescue her as fast as we can!

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:46.810
Okay, let's go!

00:11:58.530 --> 00:12:00.280
Metarex…

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:02.700
This is their base.

00:12:05.820 --> 00:12:09.040
The Chaos Emerald should be nearby.

00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:10.450
Let's go.

00:12:39.150 --> 00:12:41.240
The Chaos Emerald?

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:02.590
There are more over here!

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:08.300
Why are there so many Chaos Emeralds?

00:13:08.300 --> 00:13:10.640
The middle one is the only real Chaos Emerald.

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:15.560
This device makes replicas of the Chaos Emeralds.

00:13:18.150 --> 00:13:23.780
So the fake Chaos Emerald that we found on the snow planet was made here?

00:13:23.780 --> 00:13:26.200
What for?

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:27.820
I have no idea.

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:33.500
But there must be a connection on why they want to get the Chaos Emeralds.

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:38.170
Metarex writing.

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:41.210
If we can decipher this…

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:44.050
…stable energy…

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:48.090
93% compression rate, resulting in…

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:53.520
Implementation of the Galaxy Corridor Fortress Project...

00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:55.100
You can read it, Cosmo?

00:13:55.100 --> 00:14:00.690
Sort of. It's all technical, so I don't really understand.

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:01.860
I'm sorry.

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:03.780
It's more than enough!

00:14:03.780 --> 00:14:06.200
Let's download this data right away!

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:16.910
I'll use a translation program and analyze it later.

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:18.790
Will you help me?

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:20.630
Yes, of course.

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:24.050
I'll do the best I can, even though I'm never helpful.

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:28.220
Cosmo, are you still bothered about what just happened?

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:30.220
What are you doing there?

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:35.470
Cosmo! Grab the original!

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:36.310
Okay!

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:42.230
You're our enemy! I won't let you have the Chaos Emerald!

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:09.550
Emergency! Intruders are escaping with the Chaos Emerald!

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:15.350
By tracking the Chaos Emerald, I know where you are!

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:31.110
They'll find us if we don't escape quickly!

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:32.410
Just watch.

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:37.200
What's this?

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:40.210
These machines release Chaos Emerald-like energy waves.

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:43.000
If I send them throughout the caves...

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:47.670
Tails, you're incredible!

00:15:53.640 --> 00:15:55.390
What's going on?

00:15:57.810 --> 00:16:00.850
Even though it's not much, I can feel the wind blowing.

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:03.150
That means we're heading towards the exit!

00:16:03.150 --> 00:16:03.770
Yes.

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:06.150
This light...

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:11.700
It's similar to the light in Mother's room.

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:16.910
It's kind and a bit lonely.

00:16:17.530 --> 00:16:21.290
Cosmo, is this the first time you've really looked at a Chaos Emerald?

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:29.000
I was surprised when I heard that other planets knew about Sonic and the Chaos Emeralds.

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:34.130
My people looked for ways to defeat the Metarex.

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:40.720
That's how we learned about the seven gems that possessed incredible power.

00:16:40.720 --> 00:16:45.270
The Chaos Emeralds unleash their power by reacting to people's hearts.

00:16:45.270 --> 00:16:46.980
People's hearts?

00:16:46.980 --> 00:16:50.860
Courage and hope, trust and love.

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:55.820
Sonic uses our emotions to draw out the power of the Chaos Emeralds.

00:16:56.620 --> 00:17:01.580
But there are others who use hate and sadness to unleash its power.

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:05.580
Those powers only lead to destruction and violence.

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:10.210
Cosmo?

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:15.470
Like I thought, I'm not worthy of holding the Chaos Emerald.

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:18.390
Why?

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:23.140
Because I have so much hate and sadness within me.

00:17:23.140 --> 00:17:28.400
I still hate the Metarex for killing my people.

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:32.570
And I dragged you into this battle even though you have nothing to do with this.

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:39.280
My hatred and sadness will lead you all to destruction!

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:40.910
Cosmo…

00:17:45.870 --> 00:17:47.370
Tails!

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:52.880
Metarex!

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:55.420
I finally caught up with you.

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:58.840
Tails, let's forget about it and flee!

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:01.140
Tails?

00:18:02.430 --> 00:18:05.390
What can two pipsqueaks do?

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:18.450
Cosmo, even we feel hate and sadness.

00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:23.410
But I believe in my friends! They'll always help me in my time of need!

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:25.620
Friends…

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:29.960
As long as we feel this way, we will never lose!

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:38.470
Cosmo!

00:18:40.010 --> 00:18:42.470
I won't let you have it!

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:47.520
Oh no!

00:18:48.230 --> 00:18:49.770
Tails!

00:18:51.110 --> 00:18:54.020
Did you think I'd fall for the same trick twice?

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:00.450
Tails!

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:02.490
Cosmo! Answer me!

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:06.500
Everyone, we're over here!

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:09.750
Yes! I'm here too!

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:18.510
What? Who is it?

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:19.550
A friend!

00:19:19.550 --> 00:19:20.470
What?

00:19:26.520 --> 00:19:28.270
Cosmo, are you all right?

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:29.440
Tails!

00:19:29.440 --> 00:19:30.890
You two!

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:32.810
You're okay!

00:19:33.650 --> 00:19:36.280
You came for us!

00:19:36.280 --> 00:19:37.860
Of course.

00:19:37.860 --> 00:19:42.530
Are you okay? We're here, so you have nothing to worry about.

00:19:42.530 --> 00:19:43.910
Cream!

00:19:46.040 --> 00:19:49.120
Squash them all!

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:51.500
You're the one who's going to be squashed!

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:53.460
Let's go all out!

00:19:55.340 --> 00:19:56.800
Roger!

00:20:24.530 --> 00:20:28.330
See? We're not easy to defeat.

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:29.370
Yes!

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:31.040
Let's go.

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:35.630
Sonic! I'm taking you on!

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:36.840
Come on!

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:38.340
Sonic!

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:40.960
Chaos Emerald!

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:43.470
Got it!

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:47.970
Here I go!

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:06.120
Wow! If we analyze this data, we can find out Metarex's goals and location!

00:21:06.120 --> 00:21:11.200
We also may find out the location of our planet's Planet Egg.

00:21:12.370 --> 00:21:16.170
We have this thanks to Cosmo, right?

00:21:16.170 --> 00:21:21.840
No, all I did was accidentally push a trap switch.

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:25.930
That's right. Cosmo opened the path.

00:21:25.930 --> 00:21:28.180
Cosmo, you're fantastic!

00:21:35.810 --> 00:21:38.650
Let's get going.

00:21:38.650 --> 00:21:41.360
We retrieved a Chaos Emerald!

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:46.160
Let's defeat the Metarex and get our Planet Egg back!

00:21:46.160 --> 00:21:47.360
Yeah!

00:21:49.450 --> 00:21:50.660
Huh?

00:21:52.160 --> 00:21:54.120
Where am I?

00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:57.250
Tails? Cosmo?

00:22:00.290 --> 00:22:01.840
Why are you laughing?

00:22:01.840 --> 00:22:05.130
Tails, how'd you get out?

00:22:05.380 --> 00:22:09.010
Stop laughing and answer me!

00:22:09.010 --> 00:22:13.890
I don't know what's going on because I was digging underground like a mole!

00:22:13.890 --> 00:22:15.600
Answer me already!

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:20.730
They fell for the bait.

00:22:24.490 --> 00:22:28.030
I also gave the same bait to Eggman.

00:22:28.280 --> 00:22:34.750
They will soon gather, bringing the Chaos Emeralds with them.

00:22:35.450 --> 00:22:42.380
I will finish them once and for all so that they can no longer disturb order!

